arch support from artificial intelligence. AI assisted in compiling information from public sources, and the final content was reviewed by our editor before publishing. We update listings as new information becomes available.\n\n**Sources consulted:** On-site visit by author · Developer official website · State RERA portal verification · Google Maps location data · YouTube site-visit walkthroughs · Direct broker network.\n\nLast reviewed: 3 May 2026 · [Spot an error? Let us know](/contact)\n\n## Related News\n\n* [Lodha (macrotech Developers) Enters Gurugram Via Joint Development Agreement With Mrg Group; Two Projects Worth ₹3,600 Crore Planned On Dwarka Expressway And Golf Course Extension Road](/news/lodha-macrotech-developers-enters-gurugram-via-joint-development-agreement-with-mrg-group-two-projects-worth-3600-crore-planned-on-dwarka-expressway-and-golf-course-extension-road.html)\n* [Lodha Developers Acquires 80% Stake In Pune-based Solidrise Realty For ₹294 Crore, Plans Major Residential Expansion In Maharashtra's Second-largest City](/news/lodha-developers-acquires-80-stake-in-pune-based-solidrise-realty-for-294-crore-plans-major-residential-expansion-in-maharashtras-second-largest-city.html)\n* [Lodha Developers Signs ₹365 Crore Joint Development Agreement With Sahana Group For 10-acre Land Parcel In Parel–sewri, Mumbai](/news/lodha-developers-signs-365-crore-joint-development-agreement-with-sahana-group-for-10-acre-land-parcel-in-parelsewri-mumbai.html)\n* [Godrej Properties And Lodha Developers Acquire 25+ Land Parcels Worth ₹1 Lakh Crore Housing Pipeline In Fy26](/news/godrej-properties-and-lodha-developers-acquire-25-land-parcels-worth-1-lakh-crore-housing-pipeline-in-fy26.html)\n* [Birla Estates Enters Mumbai Redevelopment Market With ₹1,700 Crore Luxury Project In Khar West](/news/birla-estates-enters-mumbai-redevelopment-market-with-1700-crore-luxury-project-in-khar-west.html)\n* [Arkade Developers Signs Mou To Acquire 3.54-acre Land In Bhandup West, 