he Lodha Group is India's premier real estate developer. The Group is currently developing in excess of 30 million sqft of prime real estate, with over 27 projects in and around Mumbai, from Napean Sea Road to Dombivali. The Group has further extended its promise of luxury living with successful projects in Hyderabad and Pune. We believe real estate is more than just building the proverbial four walls, it's about 'Building a Better Life'. This is the ideology with which we at Lodha have delivered the world's finest developments that have become some of the most iconic addresses and the most desirable residences in India as well as in London.\n\n[![Image 45: Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg)](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere)\n\nIf you like Lodha Altus,\n\nDon't miss these similar projects\n\n![Image 46](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg)\n\n![Image 47: Shreeji Sharan Daivi Eterneety photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2026/07/15/Project-Photo-54-Daivi-Eterneety-Mumbai-5323937_410_1440_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹2.65 Cr - 3.50 Cr\n\n[Shreeji Sharan Daivi Eterneety](https://www.magicbricks.com/shreeji-sharan-daivi-eterneety-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333233393337)\n\nBorivali West\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 48: Kalpataru Advay photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/08/30/Project-Photo-8-Kalpataru-Advay-Mumbai-5422833_410_1440_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹2.53 Cr - 6.35 Cr\n\n[Kalpataru Advay](https://www.magicbricks.com/kalpataru-advay-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343232383333)\n\nBorivali West\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 49: Arkade Crown photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/10/10/Project-Photo-1-Arkade-Crown-Mumbai-5332557_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹1.91 Cr - 5.72 Cr\n\n[Arkade Crown](