isory.com/buy/new/lodha-altus-borivali-project-borivali-west-mumbai/612","title":"Lodha Altus Borivali | Luxury Apartments in Borivali West | Price Starts ₹4.70 Cr","raw_content":"[![keystonerealestateadvisory.com](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/gallery/ks-logo.webp)](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n\nAll Categories\n\n* All Categories\n* Shops\n* Hotels\n* Restaurants\n* Bars\n* Events\n* Fitness\n\n\n\n1. [Home](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n2. [Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Borivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-borivali-west-mumbai)\n5. Lodha Altus Borivali\n\n[![Lodha Altus Borivali Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/pUnKiyYc7pVQ3RcyI47IPe6v3FhFtPh8J4P1xYmL.webp)](#)\n\n[![Lodha Altus Borivali Project Images 2](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/gAcXHm8AeB6F1PXmjlGZLxdiWBvay5arDA7FAvmx.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Lodha Altus Borivali\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n![Parking Type](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Parking Type\n\n1.7 Acres\n\nG + 40 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nApril 2028\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n* Modern infrastructure\n* 3 BHK and 4 BHK Residential Apartments\n* Peaceful Ambience\n* Guaranteed Returns\n* Reputable builder with advanced security and high tech\n* 24-hour power supply backup\n* More Greenery\n* 24-hour water supply\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\nWelcome to Lodha Altus, a premium residential project in Saibaba Nagar, Borivali West, by the trusted Lodha Group. Inspired by Art Deco design, this project offers a blend of luxury and elegance.\n\n**Spacious Homes with Stunning Views**\n\nLodha Altus features twin towers with 3 & 4 BHK apartments, each designed for comfort and style. Enjoy **wide sundecks** with breathtaking views of **Sanjay Gandhi National Park** and **Global Pagoda sunsets**.\n\n**A Green Oasis in the City**\n\nSpread across **1.7 acres**, the project offers **85% open spaces**, creating a peaceful and green environment. Whether you love **reading under the trees** or **stargazing at night**, this place brings you closer to nature.\n\n**World-Class Amenities**\n\nExperience a luxurious lifestyle with:  \n ✔ **Swimming pool**  \n ✔ **Sports courts**  \n ✔ **Walking trails**  \n ✔ **Shopping outlets**  \n ✔ **Ganesha temple for meditation**\n\n**Prime Location & Connectivity**\n\nLocated in **Saibaba Nagar**, Lodha Altus offers a **calm yet well-connected** lifestyle. Enjoy easy access to:  \n ✔ **Western Express Highway, S.V. Road & Linking Road**  \n ✔ **Upcoming Thane-Borivali twin-tube tunnel for better connectivity**  \n ✔ **Nearby shopping centers and business hubs**\n\nLodha Altus is not just a home; it's a **lifestyle of luxury, nature, and convenience**. If you're looking for a **3 or 4 BHK flat in Borivali**, this is the perfect choice for you!\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nLodha Altus Borivali brochure\n\n## Pricing of Lodha Altus Borivali\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n* [4 BHK Apartment](#tabs-9)\n\n* [1086 sqft](#tabs-2283)\n* [1313 sqft](#tabs-2284)\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1086 sqft | Price:  ₹ 4.70 Cr\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1313 sqft | Price:  ₹ 5.68 Cr\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: | Price:\n\n* [1713 sqft](#tabs-2285)\n* [1713 sqft](#tabs-2287)\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 1713 sqft | Price:  ₹ 6.85 Cr\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 1713 sqft | Price:  ₹ 5.99 Cr\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: | Price:\n\n## Property Features of Lodha Altus Borivali\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Banquet Hall](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nVnv7aXBAjY7xGCOJG6gfa3JfUAOKFn4ktPtHEG8.webp) Banquet Hall\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp) Jogging Track\n\n* ![Sports Courts](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nbOC3ahgBFfPoXp1KsSLitr2C30r6v4wsl5bP6X8.webp) Sports Courts\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp) Kids Play Area\n\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/SFZjCUNkC7Mx0X3VU5OrVgx4mtJUvqfykBy0PZer.webp) Swimming Pool\n\n* ![Yoga Zone](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/COwM5RjENyf7U7nEW3taZHaXwLNwUKHFpeE88skI.webp) Yoga Zone\n\n* ![Gym](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/IGXHlscIm9ZRf5Dwqaa7fOuHpxoQXC8VN6qHvSos.webp) Gym\n\n* ![Party Lawn](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/lqumsNO9GdSVnYIsglmtZ9h8yL1AV87ifGnHLZJY.webp) Party Lawn\n\n---\n\n### Facilities\n\n* ![Internet / WiFi](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/Qk2lOgXBTOlbCG8rpyOK5ahEwi8EShaQLquP5ik6.webp) Internet / WiFi\n\n* ![Lift](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/PlsX6Ye4mz30wZTyU2HUzRfZZAF1UyAfAPcv7UW6.webp) Lift\n\n* ![Gas Pipeline](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/77fRi35ugy3nBpLGvEFZIc9Nzx43eeLJEWJkzUuI.webp) Gas Pipeline\n\n* ![Power Back Up](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/hyhD5ZsEryAKGW3ZBDuJfwfIbR00KY59KGRA3TdM.webp) Power Back Up\n\n* ![Parking](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/Mn1Br3z95nMIVacp1Oa7MFHiuII6ZjpgFaetLKCL.webp) Parking\n\n* ![Security System](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/6dsfc7xPvlsYjnrmZXSMQCe0h9jTiIuqmb3G3wvM.webp) Security System\n\n* ![24*7 Water](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/8r8bjKftbO1sSY8rBawv8AexZBpGB5Yes5BaCx4g.png) 24\\*7 Water\n\n* ![No open drainage around](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/rEgq45Ei79dPeWZ8gqdrkaHlp6TBQvwjWi8VpCVR.webp) No open drainage around\n\n* ![RWH](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/6byYTp3ZIU42Ra7EVGgHD6sGHIRzut9YyuObxin3.webp) RWH\n\n* ![Low Density Society](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/4foZMF2c4EhEwsr2NarWMfutpTEKnNoar48UX7tK.webp) Low Density Society\n\n* ![Gated Society](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/dDrSaKbMFrQab5ychFhoq4q88iDVDHgsAU0z9gxn.webp) Gated Society\n\n## Bank Offers\n\n![About Keystone Real Estate Advisory](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/ks/images/home-loan-banner.webp)  [Contact Us Now](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/contact)\n\n![Aditya Birla Capital](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/XGrM42hFHDybp1Y19862M4OyJ8gDOsg3EE9GTEB1.webp) 8.00% - 13.00%\n\n![Axis Bank Home Loan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/QZdtxvhynBtBOc30oXZBnWVc5XQBY2AurKebGOt2.webp) 7.60% - 8.05%\n\n![Bajaj Finserv](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/AXQcBE3UdCXzDqCrUfdYix4bnsRarkLpNFpY10H8.webp) 7.70% - 14.00%\n\n![Bank of Baroda](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6MLWA1aTbSguKjxxqZVVnPer7FyazH85YXJv5wKD.webp) 7.45% - 8.80%\n\n![Citi Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/LHciFR3ExZu3X7BihADb9fpp2Z3Di0ilFvyjptMj.webp) 6.50% - 7.40%\n\n![HDFC Home Loans](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/k3SCEAb5zwzavNb1Y4gZHIIQ3BcUHxpxXR91uXrP.webp) 8.60% - 9.50%\n\n![ICICI Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/dqWrCKj6YqYmSpdnc40KNaPQPIv9Bf22dDHhDJiq.webp) 8.40% - 9.45%\n\n![LIC Housing Finanace](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/ka0moGXIt4v3z8y16KQ8ruJG3F4rd40bQOManwKw.webp) 8.00% - 9.25%\n\n![PNB Housing](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6qI41xrrVMUFAEQxiGmSUiVbE48cfvqF8GTHp9CE.webp) 8.25% - 11.20%\n\n![SBI Home Loans](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6LuvpQu1AjCfFOMusgBFDVfK8REKUqT5rwwi9psG.webp) 8.05%-8.55%\n\n## Location of Lodha Altus Borivali\n\n### Google Map\n\n---\n\n### Location AV\n\nExperience location of Lodha Altus Borivali from the comfort of your home\n\n---\n\n### About Borivali West\n\nBorivali is a massive residential suburb often called the \"Gateway to the National Park.\" The West is known for its shopping hubs and the Gorai Creek, while the East provides direct access to nature. Highlights include the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, the Kanheri Caves, and the Pagoda in Gorai. It is a major railway terminus, ensuring that residents have easy access to the entire Western line.\n\n**Borivali West Location Offers Proximity To:**\n\n* Borivali (West) Metro Station\n* Eksar Metro Station\n* Borivali Metro Station\n* Shimpoli Metro Station\n* Borivali Railway Station\n* Gokul Hotel Borivali (W) Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Borivali West**\n\n* Burger King\n* Borivali Biryani Centre ( Chikuwadi ) BBC\n* The Veg Treat II\n* Mexichino restaurant\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Borivali West**\n\n* St. Lawrence High School\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* ORCHIDS The International School - Borivali\n* VEDANT INTERNATIONAL TODDLER TECH PRE SCHOOL\n* M.J. Junior College\n* Gokhale Educational Society's\n\n**Hospitals in Borivali West**\n\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital in Borivali\n* Lotus Superspeciality Hospital\n* Sohum Eye Care Centre | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospitals PVT.LTD.\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Borivali West**\n\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali West\n* Reliance Mall\n* ZUDIO – Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Borivali\n\n## About Lodha Group\n\n![Lodha Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/nZtsHoi2qQf6OmzYZz6eOplTaTtYJWeqxmkzd7HT.jpg)\n\n* Year Estd. 1980\n* [Projects - 124](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/lodha-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Lodha Group\n\nLodha Group is a pre-eminent Indian real estate developer renowned for its luxurious residential and commercial projects. Originating in 1980 under the visionary leadersh\n\nread more\n\nip of Mangal Prabhat Lodha, the company has evolved into a multinational conglomerate with a substantial footprint across India's major metropolitan areas and London. Synonymous with opulence and quality, Lodha has redefined the luxury living experience with iconic projects like Lodha Altamount and The World Towers. Beyond luxury, the group's portfolio encompasses a diverse range of pr